\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 # NFC Tag Manager
\f1\b0 \cf2 \strokec4 \
\
A desktop application designed to pair NFC tags with corresponding media files. This tool is built specifically to make assigning videos to organ NFC tags intuitive and user-friendly.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \strokec5 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf2 \strokec3 ## Prerequisites
\f1\b0 \cf2 \strokec5 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \strokec6 -\cf2 \strokec4  Python 3.9+\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \strokec5 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf2 \strokec3 ## Setup Instructions
\f1\b0 \cf2 \strokec5 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \strokec7 1.\cf2 \strokec5  
\f0\b \cf2 \strokec5 **Activate the Virtual Environment**
\f1\b0 \cf2 \strokec5 :\
   Before running the app, you need to load the local Python environment that contains the required libraries.\
   ```bash\
   source .venv/bin/activate\
   ```\
   
\f2\i \cf2 \strokec5 *(If the virtual environment is ever broken due to the folder being moved, you can rebuild it by running \cf2 \strokec3 `rm -rf .venv && python3 -m venv .venv && source .venv/bin/activate && pip install -r requirements.txt`\cf2 \strokec5 )*
\f1\i0 \cf2 \strokec5 \
\
\cf2 \strokec7 2.\cf2 \strokec5  
\f0\b \cf2 \strokec5 **Run the Application**
\f1\b0 \cf2 \strokec5 :\
   ```bash\
   python main.py\
   ```\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf2 \strokec3 ## Usage
\f1\b0 \cf2 \strokec5 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \strokec7 -\cf2 \strokec5  
\f0\b \cf2 \strokec5 **Simulating Scans**
\f1\b0 \cf2 \strokec5 : When developing on macOS or Windows, a "Dev: Simulate Scan" panel will appear on the bottom left. Enter any arbitrary UID (e.g., \cf2 \strokec3 `LIVER-001`\cf2 \strokec5 ) and click "Simulate" to act as if a tag was just tapped.\
\cf2 \strokec7 -\cf2 \strokec5  
\f0\b \cf2 \strokec5 **Adding/Editing Tags**
\f1\b0 \cf2 \strokec5 : Upon scanning a tag, a modal will appear prompting you to enter the Organ's Name and select its Video File. The video will be copied to the \cf2 \strokec3 `media/`\cf2 \strokec5  directory, and the relationships will be saved to \cf2 \strokec3 `tags.json`\cf2 \strokec5 .\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf2 \strokec3 ## Brand Styling
\f1\b0 \cf2 \strokec5 \
The GUI is built using \cf2 \strokec3 `customtkinter`\cf2 \strokec5  with elements conforming to the brand guidelines (Purple primary, Orange/Yellow accents, and specialized fonts).\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
